 class="hotkey-words"></span><span class="hotkey-mark">×</span></button><button class="menu-action hotkey-chip" style="display:none;" id="hotkey-fullscreen-2"><span class="hotkey-words"></span><span class="hotkey-mark">×</span></button><button class="menu-action hotkey-chip" style="display:none;" id="hotkey-fullscreen-3"><span class="hotkey-words"></span><span class="hotkey-mark">×</span></button><button class="menu-action hotkey-chip" style="display:none;" id="hotkey-fullscreen-4"><span class="hotkey-words"></span><span class="hotkey-mark">×</span></button><button class="menu-action hotkey-add" id="hotkey-fullscreen-add">+</button></div></div></div><div id="hotkeys-pager" class="list-pager" style="display:none;"><button id="hotkeys-prev" class="menu-action list-pager-prev">&lt;<span class="binding-badge"><span class="binding-key" data-binding="previous-page">Pg Up</span></span></button><div id="hotkeys-page-count" class="list-pager-count"></div><button id="hotkeys-next" class="menu-action list-pager-next">&gt;<span class="binding-badge"><span class="binding-key" data-binding="next-page">Pg Down</span></span></button></div></div><div id="hotkeys-actions"><button class="menu-action" id="hotkeys-back">BACK<span class="binding-badge"><span class="binding-key" data-binding="back">Esc</span></span></button><button class="menu-action" id="hotkeys-reset">RESET DEFAULTS</button><button class="menu-action" id="hotkeys-cancel" style="display:none;">CANCEL</button></div><div id="hotkeys-status">CHOOSE A BINDING TO REMOVE IT</div></div><div id="video-panel" class="screen-panel" style="display:none;"><div id="brightness-control"><div id="brightness-level" class="slider"><div id="brightness-level-readout" class="slider-readout"></div><div class="slider-track"><div id="brightness-level-fill" class="slider-fill"></div><div id="brightness-level-thumb" class="slider-thumb"></div></div></div>
<button id="brightness-down" class="menu-action volume-arrow arrow-down">&lt;</button><button id="brightness-up" class="menu-action volume-arrow arrow-up">&gt;</button><div id="brightness-low" class="volume-end">LOW</div><div id="brightness-high" class="volume-end">HIGH</div><div class="volume-name">BRIGHTNESS</div></div><div id="contrast-control"><div id="contrast-level" class="slider"><div id="contrast-level-readout" class="slider-readout"></div><div class="slider-track"><div id="contrast-level-fill" class="slider-fill"></div><div id="contrast-level-thumb" class="slider-thumb"></div></div></div>
<button id="contrast-down" class="menu-action volume-arrow arrow-down">&lt;</button><button id="contrast-up" class="menu-action volume-arrow arrow-up">&gt;</button><div id="contrast-low" class="volume-end">LOW</div><div id="contrast-high" class="volume-end">HIGH</div><div class="volume-name">CONTRAST</div></div><button class="menu-action" id="video-back">BACK<span class="binding-badge"><span class="binding-key" data-binding="back">Esc</span></span></button></div><div id="restart-panel" class="screen-panel" style="display:none;"><div class="confirm-copy">Are you sure? The game will start from the beginning and anything you haven't saved is lost.</div><div class="confirm-actions"><button id="restart-back" class="menu-action">NO, KEEP PLAYING<span class="binding-badge"><span class="binding-key" data-binding="back">Esc</span></span></button><button id="restart-confirm" class="menu-action">YES, RESTART</button></div></div><div id="reset-panel" class="screen-panel" style="display:none;"><div class="confirm-copy">Are you sure? This removes this game's saves and settings. The game closes.</div><div class="confirm-copy confirm-stays">The app stays. Open it again to start the game fresh.</div><div class="confirm-actions"><button id="forget-back" class="menu-action">NO, KEEP MY GAME<span class="binding-badge"><span class="binding-key" data-binding="back">Esc</span></span></button><button id="forget-confirm" class="menu-action">YES, RESET</button></div></div>
<div id="data-panel" class="screen-panel" style="display:none;"><div class="confirm-copy">You can export your game data (saves, memory cards, settings, etc.) to a zip file. You can also import a previous export.</div><div class="confirm-actions"><button id="data-export" class="menu-action">EXPORT DATA</button><button id="data-import" class="menu-action">IMPORT DATA</button></div><button id="data-back" class="menu-action">BACK<span class="binding-badge"><span class="binding-key" data-binding="back">Esc</span></span></button><div id="data-status" class="data-status"></div><div id="data-import-dialog" class="data-dialog" style="display:none;"><div class="data-dialog-title">ARE YOU SURE?</div><div id="data-import-message" class="data-dialog-copy"></div><div class="data-dialog-actions"><button id="data-import-cancel" class="menu-action">NO, KEEP MY EXISTING DATA</button><button id="data-import-confirm" class="menu-action">YES, IMPORT AND REPLACE MY DATA</button></div></div></div>
<div id="unlock-row" style="display:none;"><div id="unlock"><img id="unlock-badge"/><div id="unlock-words"><div id="unlock-kicker">ACHIEVEMENT UNLOCKED</div><div id="unlock-title"></div><div id="unlock-detail"></div></div></div></div><div id="options-panel" class="screen-panel" style="display:none;"><div id="volume-control"><div id="volume-level" class="slider"><div id="volume-level-readout" class="slider-readout"></div><div class="slider-track"><div id="volume-level-fill" class="slider-fill"></div><div id="volume-level-thumb" class="slider-thumb"></div></div></div>
<button id="volume-down" class="menu-action volume-arrow arrow-down">&lt;</button><button id="volume-up" class="menu-action volume-arrow arrow-up">&gt;</button><div id="volume-low" class="volume-end">LOW</div><div id="volume-high" class="volume-end">HIGH</div><div class="volume-name">VOLUME</div></div><div id="options-entries"><div id="options-list" class="list" data-page-size="4"><div class="list-page"><button class="menu-action option-entry" id="controls"><span class="option-label">CONTROLS</span></button><button class="menu-action option-entry" id="hotkeys"><span class="option-label">HOTKEYS</span></button><button class="menu-action option-entry" id="video"><span class="option-label">VIDEO</span></button><button class="switch menu-action option-entry" id="background-play"><span class="option-label">PLAY IN BACKGROUND <span id="background-play-state" class="setting-state"></span></span></button><button class="switch menu-action option-entry" id="rumble"><span class="option-label">RUMBLE <span id="rumble-state" class="setting-state"></span></span></button><button class="menu-action option-entry" id="reset"><span class="option-label">RESET</span></button><button class="menu-action option-entry" id="data"><span class="option-label">DATA</span></button></div><div id="options-pager" class="list-pager" style="display:none;"><button id="options-prev" class="menu-action list-pager-prev">&lt;<span class="binding-badge"><span class="binding-key" data-binding="previous-page">Pg Up</span></span></button><div id="options-page-count" class="list-pager-count"></div><button id="options-next" class="menu-action list-pager-next">&gt;<span class="binding-badge"><span class="binding-key" data-binding="next-page">Pg Down</span></span></button></div></div></div><button class="menu-action options-back" id="options-back">BACK<span class="binding-badge"><span class="binding-key" data-binding="back">Esc</span></span></button></div><div id="footer"><span id="footer-hint">{back:Esc}  CONTINUE</span><span id="version"><img id="brand-mark" src="brand-mark.png"/> ROM-IN-A-BOX / @VERSION@</span></div></div></body></rml>
